{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/33a0a8574decb1697b9202d1b93d6b3d.avif?t=1772891982\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the realm of the Child Eater.\u00a0Escape a Cold War orphanage in this 1-6 player co-op survival horror. Solve shifting puzzles, evade cultists, and survive the Child Eater\u2019s arrival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/82fe5de35719f7f4ec38b698d086932e.poster.avif?t=1772891982\" width=792 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/82fe5de35719f7f4ec38b698d086932e.webm?t=1772891982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/82fe5de35719f7f4ec38b698d086932e.mp4?t=1772891982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Escape the orphanage</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Hide. Loot. Solve puzzles. Work together.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/9b7cece3bcbe555b54589ce1ad3f95be.poster.avif?t=1772891982\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/9b7cece3bcbe555b54589ce1ad3f95be.webm?t=1772891982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/9b7cece3bcbe555b54589ce1ad3f95be.mp4?t=1772891982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/67a79dfe9ddda4519f6d8e12b49cfea6.avif?t=1772891982\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer co-op survival horror for 1-6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communcation through proximity voicechat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic escape room mechanics where every session is different: puzzle-chain system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hallucinatory horror engine that blurs reality and fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile enemies: priests, nuns, cult monsters, Child Eater</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable collectibles, titles, story pieces and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 playable characters with their unique abilites and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic 1980s eastern bloc environment, featuring pop-cultural and Cold War references</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/ab1cacefd906cf67a43fd7e69d529004.avif?t=1772891982\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in Eastern Europe in the early 1980s. The orphans (players) must figure out how to escape alive from an orphanage that harbors terrible, evil secrets. The caretakers, priests and nuns, are members of a satanic cult and the time has come for the final s\u00e9ance where all the orphans are to be sacrificed to unleash demonic forces on the world and bring demonic power to earth by the &quot;Child Eater&quot;. Secret story elements are revealed by playing through the game multiple times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/1ea404a059474ec2971eebca5661aca0.poster.avif?t=1772891982\" width=800 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/1ea404a059474ec2971eebca5661aca0.webm?t=1772891982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/1ea404a059474ec2971eebca5661aca0.mp4?t=1772891982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The running orphan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/f4c28d866a2b91c14d0012b200429d8c92db81c4.jpg"},{"name":"Get Away From Her, You B*tch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/168e17bdebdae17e232cbccf9f5dec9a439f27a5.jpg"},{"name":"I want to break free!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/0a752d64096959e0543827bf827f251b88ca367c.jpg"},{"name":"No Fate But What We Make","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/05c1ba607ea8eeb8821bff362b39d0597a0d0bad.jpg"},{"name":"Not a Drop of Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/621c83d7bf64716a77bfe1942719e65dca65585b.jpg"},{"name":"The Director\u2019s Cut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/ba2cbc1f0343cf9a3aef831f459cf0fec7727372.jpg"},{"name":"Play It Loud","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/26415b43587b6613f70665a6059b8525d4d938d1.jpg"},{"name":"Sugar Rush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/5848611dfe3f30d68b8841e005715397115ca150.jpg"},{"name":"Hail to the King!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/b7e5088a1378928aa586516204680b4eba559fc5.jpg"},{"name":"I'm the Capitain Now!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170640/60d4a96efbd016ee091b5013d5c41b6080f93407.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3170640?t=1772891982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772891982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/e123f98002f2cab1a25fd5945f935c5f6742a858/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772891982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/e123f98002f2cab1a25fd5945f935c5f6742a858/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772891982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The aim of the game is entertainment.\r\nAs it belongs to the horror genre, there are of course frightening and grotesque characters. However, the game endeavours to avoid gory scenes and the depiction of gratuitous violence.\r\n\r\nThe game is a psychological horror, i.e. it exerts pressure on players through mental and emotional tension rather than visible physical horrors."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3170640/extras/33a0a857